        <rdfs:comment>Originally described in the dendritic cell ontology (DC_CL:0000042)(PMID:19243617). GMPs are reportedly CD16-positive, CD32-positive, CD34-positive, CD38-positive, CD45RA-positive, CD110-negative, CD117-positive, CD123-positive, and SCA1-negative.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>granulocyte monocyte progenitor cell</rdfs:label>
