        <rdfs:comment>The marker set DOK5, ST6GALNAC3 can identify the Human cell type http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0000752 in the retina with a confidence of 0.782434709 (NS-Forest FBeta value).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>cone retinal bipolar cell</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
