        <obo:IAO_0000115>A hematopoietic stem cell capable of rapid replenishment of myeloerythroid progenitors and limited self renewal capability. This cell is Kit-positive, Sca1-positive, CD34-positive, CD150-positive, and is Flt3-negative.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <terms:contributor rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1980-3228"/>
