        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>ST-HSC</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>Markers are associated with mouse cells. These cells are also reportedly CD11b-low and CD90-low.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>short term hematopoietic stem cell</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
