        <obo:IAO_0000115>An enteroendocrine cell commonest in the duodenum and jejunum, rare in ileum, that secretes cholecystokinin. This cell type is involved in the regulation of digestive enzymes and bile.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <terms:contributor rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1980-3228"/>
